        "description": {
          "type": "/type/text",
          "value": "\"From the zeros of the mathematicians to the void of the philosophers, from Shakespeare to the empty set, from the ether to the quantum vacuum, from being and nothingness to creatio ex nihilo, there is much ado about nothing at the heart of things. Recent exciting discoveries in astronomy are shown to shed new light on the nature of the vaccuum and its dramatic effect upon the explanation of the Universe.\"--Jacket."
